OL,3,GNEWSABulldog cross ready for adoption
OL,4,Aafter 'nose job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bulldog cross is ready to be adopted
OL,7,Fafter having surgery to fix her
OL,8,Fbreathing difficulty, a rescue centre
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FThe RSPCA said five-year-old dog Callie
OL,12,Fwas underweight and withdrawn when she
OL,13,Farrived at its Millbrook Animal Centre
OL,14,Fin Chobham, Surrey, in July.
OL,16,FStaff later noticed she was struggling
OL,17,Fto breathe and her nostrils were
OL,18,F"unusually narrow for a dog of her
OL,19,Fsize".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
