OL,3,GNEWSABulldog cross ready for adoption
OL,4,Aafter 'nose job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter undergoing surgery to widen her
OL,7,Fnostrils and shorten her soft palate,
OL,8,FCallie is ready to "make someone the
OL,9,Fmost wonderful companion", the animal
OL,10,Fcharity said.
